{"id":"7fc5fa30c0841ef9","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-standard-cnf.md","title":"Chomsky Normal Form","display":"df-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-standard-cnf","aliases":["73-df-standard-cnf","73-df-chomsky-normal-form"],"display":"df-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal Form","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-structure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; local fresh-start epsilon extension","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-standard-cnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-standard-cnf</span><span>73-df-chomsky-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; local fresh-start epsilon extension"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free grammar, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists B,C\\in V\\;(\\alpha=BC)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists B,C\\in V\\;(\\alpha=BC)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The optional production <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\to\\varepsilon\">\\(S\\to\\varepsilon\\)</span> handles languages containing the empty word.</li>\n<li>Excluding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> from every right-hand side makes that epsilon exception compatible with the usual CNF conversion theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-structure]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists B,C\\in V\\;(\\alpha=BC)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"S\\to\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1761,"backlinks":[{"id":"efcd33b278c102f5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CNF}(G)$，见 [[73-df-standard-cnf]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$，截取 $w[i:j]$ 见 [[73-df-word-factors]]。$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；各递归子句另外满足所显示的区间条件，分割变量 $k$ 由有限并的整数下标绑定。$C_{G,w}$ 的递归按区间长度 $j-i$ 进行。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-standard-cnf|Chomsky Normal Form]]"},{"id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}$ (grammars in Chomsky normal form, see [[73-df-standard-cnf]])"}],"outgoing":["33052f37223a11c6"]}